#: kidradd/comic172.htm:36
msgctxt "comic172#title.1"
msgid "\"NO REGRETS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic172 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic172.htm:73
msgctxt "comic172#p1.1"
msgid "Back at the diner, Sheena and Bogey discuss Radd's fate."
msgstr ""

#. comic172 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic172.htm:79
msgctxt "comic172#p1.2"
msgid "Bogey, do you think arresting Radd was the right choice?"
msgstr ""

#. comic172 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic172.htm:81
msgctxt "comic172#p1.3"
msgid "Probably."
msgstr ""

#. comic172 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeyup2.gif
#: kidradd/comic172.htm:136
msgctxt "comic172#p2.1"
msgid "I mean, do you suppose working in an offline application will really rehabilitate him?"
msgstr ""

#. comic172 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeyup2.gif
#: kidradd/comic172.htm:140
msgctxt "comic172#p2.2"
msgid "It's worth a try."
msgstr ""

#. comic172 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif, bogeyup.gif
#: kidradd/comic172.htm:187
msgctxt "comic172#p3.1"
msgid "It must be painful to watch your friend slip into an illegal spiral of self-destruction."
msgstr ""

#. comic172 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif, bogeyup.gif
#: kidradd/comic172.htm:191
msgctxt "comic172#p3.2"
msgid "Yep. Devastating."
msgstr ""

#. comic172 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenamad.gif, bogeyupt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic172.htm:239
msgctxt "comic172#p4.1"
msgid "...Or you might just be glad to get him out of your apartment."
msgstr ""

#. comic172 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenamad.gif, bogeyupt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic172.htm:243
msgctxt "comic172#p4.2"
msgid "Damn straight."
msgstr ""

#. comic173 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:36
msgctxt "comic173#title.1"
msgid "\"TOUGH LOVE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic173 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenamad.gif, bogeyupt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:77
msgctxt "comic173#p1.1"
msgid "Bogey, you should be ashamed of yourself, taking glee in Radd's misfortune."
msgstr ""

#. comic173 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenamad.gif, bogeyupt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:81
msgctxt "comic173#p1.2"
msgid "Hey, I do care about the guy, or else I wouldn't have saved him."
msgstr ""

#. comic173 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeytabled2.gif
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:134
msgctxt "comic173#p2.1"
msgid "But Radd still hasn't learned how things work in the real world, and needs to learn to play by the rules. If nothing else, this'll teach him that his actions have consequences."
msgstr ""

#. comic173 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif, bogeyupt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:185
msgctxt "comic173#p3.1"
msgid "I guess you're right."
msgstr ""

#. comic173 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif, bogeyupt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:189
msgctxt "comic173#p3.2"
msgid "Plus, it frees up some closetspace for me."
msgstr ""

#. comic173 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenamad.gif, bogeyupt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:237
msgctxt "comic173#p4.1"
msgid "I'm glad to see your priorities are straight."
msgstr ""

#. comic173 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenamad.gif, bogeyupt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic173.htm:241
msgctxt "comic173#p4.2"
msgid "And I won't have to vacuum nearly as often, either!"
msgstr ""

#. comic174 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic174.htm:36
msgctxt "comic174#title.1"
msgid "\"MAN IN THE MIRROR\""
msgstr ""

#. comic174 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand.gif, amp2.gif
#: kidradd/comic174.htm:73
msgctxt "comic174#p1.1"
msgid "Later that same day."
msgstr ""

#. comic174 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand.gif, amp2.gif
#: kidradd/comic174.htm:79
msgctxt "comic174#p1.2"
msgid "You called us, Dr. Amp?"
msgstr ""

#. comic174 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand.gif, amp2.gif
#: kidradd/comic174.htm:83
msgctxt "comic174#p1.3"
msgid "Yes, I've made a wonderful discovery!"
msgstr ""

#. comic174 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand.gif, amp.gif
#: kidradd/comic174.htm:140
msgctxt "comic174#p2.1"
msgid "As you know, the puzzle sprites you brought me have been chronically depressed since leaving their game."
msgstr ""

#. comic174 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: amptable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic174.htm:191
msgctxt "comic174#p3.1"
msgid "Since earning points was the only thing that made them happy, I needed to find a way to simulate that action without making them disappear."
msgstr ""

#. comic174 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: amp.gif, sheenastand.gif, bogeysigh.gif, mirrors.gif
#: kidradd/comic174.htm:238
msgctxt "comic174#p4.1"
msgid "Behold the solution!"
msgstr ""

#. comic174 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: amp.gif, sheenastand.gif, bogeysigh.gif, mirrors.gif
#: kidradd/comic174.htm:240
msgctxt "comic174#p4.2"
msgid "Mirrors?"
msgstr ""

#. comic174 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: amp.gif, sheenastand.gif, bogeysigh.gif, mirrors.gif
#: kidradd/comic174.htm:242
msgctxt "comic174#p4.3"
msgid "Great, now the little guys can shave."
msgstr ""

#. comic175 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic175.htm:36
msgctxt "comic175#title.1"
msgid "\"FLASHDANCE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic175 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand.gif, amp.gif, mirrors.gif
#: kidradd/comic175.htm:77
msgctxt "comic175#p1.1"
msgid "Now, the puzzles sprites' programming makes them happy when they line up, but that makes them disappear."
msgstr ""

#. comic175 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bigmirror.gif
#: kidradd/comic175.htm:134
msgctxt "comic175#p2.1"
msgid "But if they think they're lined up, even when they really aren't, that makes them happy anyway. So I just introduce them to mirrors, and..."
msgstr ""

#. comic175 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand.gif, amp.gif, mirror2.gif
#: kidradd/comic175.htm:185
msgctxt "comic175#p3.1"
msgid "Ta daa! It thinks it's scoring, but it's not!"
msgstr ""

#. comic175 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenano.gif, bogeyyell.gif, amp.gif, mirror3.gif
#: kidradd/comic175.htm:237
msgctxt "comic175#p4.1"
msgid "That's highly disturbing, and yet I'm envious."
msgstr ""

#. comic175 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenano.gif, bogeyyell.gif, amp.gif, mirror3.gif
#: kidradd/comic175.htm:239
msgctxt "comic175#p4.2"
msgid "Look at 'im go!"
msgstr ""

#. comic175 panel p4
#. slot: bubble "stems"
#. images: sheenano.gif, bogeyyell.gif, amp.gif, mirror3.gif
#: kidradd/comic175.htm:245
msgctxt "comic175#p4.3"
msgid "score!"
msgstr ""

#. comic176 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic176.htm:36
msgctxt "comic176#title.1"
msgid "\"EPILEPTIC? SKIP THIS ONE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic176 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand.gif, amp.gif, mirror3.gif
#: kidradd/comic176.htm:77
msgctxt "comic176#p1.1"
msgid "The amazing thing is, these guys produce energy when they flash."
msgstr ""

#. comic176 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: amptable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic176.htm:138
msgctxt "comic176#p2.1"
msgid "So I've constructed a series of mirrored cublicles for them, and they continuously generate power for my lab."
msgstr ""

#. comic176 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand.gif, amp2.gif, mirror3.gif
#: kidradd/comic176.htm:185
msgctxt "comic176#p3.1"
msgid "I still don't understand how they do it, though. It's almost like a, a..."
msgstr ""

#. comic176 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeysigh.gif, amp2.gif, mirror3.gif
#: kidradd/comic176.htm:237
msgctxt "comic176#p4.1"
msgid "Plot device?"
msgstr ""

#. comic176 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeysigh.gif, amp2.gif, mirror3.gif
#: kidradd/comic176.htm:241
msgctxt "comic176#p4.2"
msgid "Exactly!"
msgstr ""

#. comic177 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic177.htm:36
msgctxt "comic177#title.1"
msgid "\"CAN'T ALWAYS GET WHAT YOU WANT\""
msgstr ""

#. comic177 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic177.htm:79
msgctxt "comic177#p1.1"
msgid "Well, it's nice to know that the puzzle sprites are taken care of, but..."
msgstr ""

#. comic177 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand2.gif, closet.gif
#: kidradd/comic177.htm:133
msgctxt "comic177#p2.1"
msgid "There's still tons of immobile or useless sprites rotting in our RAM warehouse, and Amp can't save them all."
msgstr ""

#. comic177 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenatable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic177.htm:185
msgctxt "comic177#p3.1"
msgid "And every time we destroy a game, there's always a few sprites left unhappy, sigh..."
msgstr ""

#. comic177 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, sheenablink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic177.htm:236
msgctxt "comic177#p4.1"
msgid "Ready for today's mission?"
msgstr ""

#. comic177 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, sheenablink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic177.htm:240
msgctxt "comic177#p4.2"
msgid "Can't wait."
msgstr ""

#. comic178 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic178.htm:50
msgctxt "comic178#title.1"
msgid "\"NOW YOU'RE GONE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic178 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: implodeb.gif
#: kidradd/comic178.htm:91
msgctxt "comic178#p1.1"
msgid "Okay, all the sprites have been evacuated."
msgstr ""

#. comic178 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: implodeb.gif
#: kidradd/comic178.htm:95
msgctxt "comic178#p1.2"
msgid "Let's go. The game's about to implode."
msgstr ""

#. comic178 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenabeds.gif
#: kidradd/comic178.htm:177
msgctxt "comic178#p3.1"
msgid "NOOOOO!!!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic178 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenabed.gif
#: kidradd/comic178.htm:230
msgctxt "comic178#p4.1"
msgid "No... I...<br>I can only hope that was just a dream..."
msgstr ""

#. comic179 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic179.htm:36
msgctxt "comic179#title.1"
msgid "\"MOVING OUT\""
msgstr ""

#. comic179 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenadesk.gif, desk.gif
#: kidradd/comic179.htm:77
msgctxt "comic179#p1.1"
msgid "To: Captain QB<br>From: Sheena<br>Re: Sprite Rescue<br>Cc: Moderators Staff"
msgstr ""

#. comic179 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenadesk.gif, desk.gif
#: kidradd/comic179.htm:131
msgctxt "comic179#p2.1"
msgid "Although I realize that I have bettered the lives of hundreds of sprites by performing my job, this knowlege no longer gladdens me. My heart just isn't in it lately, due to serious misgivings I can no longer ignore."
msgstr ""

#. comic179 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenadesk.gif, desk.gif
#: kidradd/comic179.htm:182
msgctxt "comic179#p3.1"
msgid "My primary problem is that I can't turn a blind eye to the sprites made unhappy by my actions. Even if they are the minority, I cannot bear to put another sprite in the RAM warehouse."
msgstr ""

#. comic179 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenadesk.gif, desk.gif
#: kidradd/comic179.htm:233
msgctxt "comic179#p4.1"
msgid "My other misgiving, which may be only paranoia, is my fear that in evacuation of games, silent and/or immobile sprites may be left behind. We are never truly certain that all are outside when the game finally collapses. I never want to be responsible for the death of an innocent sprite."
msgstr ""

#. comic179 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenadesk.gif, desk.gif
#: kidradd/comic179.htm:285
msgctxt "comic179#p5.1"
msgid "And so, until the day that we can open games without destroying them, and give their denizens a choice to be free without harming them, I can no longer participate in these rescues. I hereby resign my position in the Moderators.<br><br>Sheena"
msgstr ""

#. comic180 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic180.htm:36
msgctxt "comic180#title.1"
msgid "\"VOICES CARRY\""
msgstr ""

#. comic180 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic180.htm:79
msgctxt "comic180#p1.1"
msgid "Done. I've written my letter of resignation."
msgstr ""

#. comic180 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenahall.gif
#: kidradd/comic180.htm:133
msgctxt "comic180#p2.1"
msgid "Now all that's left to do is turn it in. I hope they understand, it's what I have to do."
msgstr ""

#. comic180 panel p2
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#. images: sheenahall.gif
#: kidradd/comic180.htm:146
msgctxt "comic180#p2.2"
msgid "The miracle of cycled animation."
msgstr ""

#. comic180 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastare2.gif, closet.gif
#: kidradd/comic180.htm:189
msgctxt "comic180#p3.1"
msgid "...Maybe he's dangerous, but do we really need to... </font><font size=\"1\" face=\"arial\" color=\"white\">to <u>kill</u> this Radd guy?"
msgstr ""

#. comic180 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: thought2.gif, sheenablink2.gif, closet.gif
#: kidradd/comic180.htm:237
msgctxt "comic180#p4.1"
msgid "I am <b>so</b> going to regret hearing that."
msgstr ""

#. comic180 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: thought2.gif, sheenablink2.gif, closet.gif
#: kidradd/comic180.htm:241
msgctxt "comic180#p4.2"
msgid "There's no need to whisper, sir. These rooms are soundproof."
msgstr ""

#. comic181 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic181.htm:36
msgctxt "comic181#title.1"
msgid "\"DEAL WITH THE DEVIL\""
msgstr ""

#. comic181 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: thought2.gif, sheenastand.gif, closet.gif
#: kidradd/comic181.htm:77
msgctxt "comic181#p1.1"
msgid "That sounds like QB?"
msgstr ""

#. comic181 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: thought2.gif, sheenastand.gif, closet.gif
#: kidradd/comic181.htm:81
msgctxt "comic181#p1.2"
msgid "How on earth did you get this information?"
msgstr ""

#. comic181 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbstand.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic181.htm:133
msgctxt "comic181#p2.1"
msgid "Cuz it sounds bogus to me."
msgstr ""

#. comic181 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbstand.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic181.htm:137
msgctxt "comic181#p2.2"
msgid "Fool! The danger of this sprite was revealed to me by the Seer himself."
msgstr ""

#. comic181 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic181.htm:185
msgctxt "comic181#p3.1"
msgid "The Seer? Are you insane? You know what happens to people who talk to him?"
msgstr ""

#. comic181 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic181.htm:189
msgctxt "comic181#p3.2"
msgid "I know the price, Captain. He can tell you how to obtain whatever you desire, <i>anything</i>..."
msgstr ""

#. comic181 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenano.gif, closet.gif
#: kidradd/comic181.htm:241
msgctxt "comic181#p4.1"
msgid "...But it will cost you your life."
msgstr ""

#. comic182 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic182.htm:36
msgctxt "comic182#title.1"
msgid "\"I'M GONNA LIVE FOREVER\""
msgstr ""

#. comic182 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbstand.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic182.htm:77
msgctxt "comic182#p1.1"
msgid "Crystal, you've totally lost it this time."
msgstr ""

#. comic182 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbstand.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic182.htm:81
msgctxt "comic182#p1.2"
msgid "On the contrary, I have never been more lucid."
msgstr ""

#. comic182 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic182.htm:133
msgctxt "comic182#p2.1"
msgid "Within weeks you will die a tragic, seemingly coincidental death. What could you have asked for that could possibly be worth that?"
msgstr ""

#. comic182 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic182.htm:137
msgctxt "comic182#p2.2"
msgid "Simple."
msgstr ""

#. comic182 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: chead.gif
#: kidradd/comic182.htm:187
msgctxt "comic182#p3.1"
msgid "Ultimate power, such as humans have. Divine control over all things including life and death. In short, <b>immortality.</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic182 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbstand.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic182.htm:237
msgctxt "comic182#p4.1"
msgid "Oh. Y'know, that's actually pretty clever."
msgstr ""

#. comic182 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbstand.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic182.htm:241
msgctxt "comic182#p4.2"
msgid "Explain to me again why you outrank me."
msgstr ""

#. comic183 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic183.htm:36
msgctxt "comic183#title.1"
msgid "\"TEMPTATION\""
msgstr ""

#. comic183 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, closet.gif
#: kidradd/comic183.htm:81
msgctxt "comic183#p1.1"
msgid "But Crystal, if you asked for your own immortality..."
msgstr ""

#. comic183 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic183.htm:133
msgctxt "comic183#p2.1"
msgid "...What does that have to do with Radd being a danger to the Moderators?"
msgstr ""

#. comic183 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic183.htm:137
msgctxt "comic183#p2.2"
msgid "It's a bit indirect."
msgstr ""

#. comic183 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: chead.gif
#: kidradd/comic183.htm:187
msgctxt "comic183#p3.1"
msgid "The Seer outlined several steps I would need to achieve my goal. One of them is the elimination of Radd, who may still be able to kill me even if I become immortal."
msgstr ""

#. comic183 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic183.htm:237
msgctxt "comic183#p4.1"
msgid "But that doesn't -"
msgstr ""

#. comic183 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic183.htm:241
msgctxt "comic183#p4.2"
msgid "Another step is to lead the Moderators to rule the entire web."
msgstr ""

#. comic183 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbstand2.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic183.htm:291
msgctxt "comic183#p5.1"
msgid "My conscience is getting all prickly."
msgstr ""

#. comic183 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbstand2.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic183.htm:295
msgctxt "comic183#p5.2"
msgid "A bit of absolute power can remedy that."
msgstr ""

#. comic184 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic184.htm:36
msgctxt "comic184#title.1"
msgid "\"NO MORE MR. NICE GUY\""
msgstr ""

#. comic184 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbstand2.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic184.htm:77
msgctxt "comic184#p1.1"
msgid "I don't like the sound of this; the Moderators are supposed to be the symbol of freedom and justice."
msgstr ""

#. comic184 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbstand2.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic184.htm:81
msgctxt "comic184#p1.2"
msgid "I need your answer, Captain."
msgstr ""

#. comic184 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbtable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic184.htm:136
msgctxt "comic184#p2.1"
msgid "If Crystal can really give the Moderators sovereignty over the entire web, millions of sprites will be freed from human oppression. That's a goal I'd give almost anything for, but..."
msgstr ""

#. comic184 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbtable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic184.htm:187
msgctxt "comic184#p3.1"
msgid "It's like the humans' own hypothetical dilemma, about whether saving millions of people is adequate justification for killing one man. Well, is it?"
msgstr ""

#. comic184 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbtable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic184.htm:238
msgctxt "comic184#p4.1"
msgid "But there's a difference here: the person most humans reference in this puzzle is undeniably evil; whereas the victim of our sacrifice, Radd, probably isn't. He's a criminal, sure, but evil? Hardly. But could sparing this one loser really be the best choice for the millions of enslaved sprites out there?"
msgstr ""

#. comic184 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbstand2.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic184.htm:291
msgctxt "comic184#p5.1"
msgid "Captain?"
msgstr ""

#. comic184 panel p6
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbstands.gif
#: kidradd/comic184.htm:341
msgctxt "comic184#p6.1"
msgid "I'll do it."
msgstr ""

#. comic185 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic185.htm:36
msgctxt "comic185#title.1"
msgid "\"SOMEBODY'S WATCHING ME\""
msgstr ""

#. comic185 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic185.htm:77
msgctxt "comic185#p1.1"
msgid "Alright, I'll take care of the criminal."
msgstr ""

#. comic185 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbtalk.gif, fairy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic185.htm:81
msgctxt "comic185#p1.2"
msgid "Thank you Captain, you won't regret it."
msgstr ""

#. comic185 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: qbstand2.gif, fairy.gif
#: kidradd/comic185.htm:133
msgctxt "comic185#p2.1"
msgid "(That remains to be seen.) Any other preparations you need, well, you know my assistants."
msgstr ""

#. comic185 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: qbstand2.gif, fairy.gif
#: kidradd/comic185.htm:137
msgctxt "comic185#p2.2"
msgid "Apreciated. I'll be using the files in here for a bit, if you don't mind."
msgstr ""

#. comic185 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: thought.gif, qbstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic185.htm:185
msgctxt "comic185#p3.1"
msgid "Oy, what have I gotten myself into? Well, I'd better get moving."
msgstr ""

#. comic185 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenano.gif, qbtalk2.gif, closet.gif
#: kidradd/comic185.htm:240
msgctxt "comic185#p4.1"
msgid "Oh, hi Sheena. Um, you didn't happen to hear any of that, did you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic185 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenabl.gif, qbstand2.gif, closet.gif
#: kidradd/comic185.htm:290
msgctxt "comic185#p5.1"
msgid "Errrr... no! Like your friend said, the room's soundproof!"
msgstr ""

#. comic185 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenabl.gif, qbstand2.gif, closet.gif
#: kidradd/comic185.htm:294
msgctxt "comic185#p5.2"
msgid "Okay. Whew!"
msgstr ""

#. comic186 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic186.htm:35
msgctxt "comic186#title.1"
msgid "\"BREATHLESS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic186 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: raddsit.gif
#: kidradd/comic186.htm:72
msgctxt "comic186#p1.1"
msgid "Now that the plot has advanced a little, let's check back on our hero, shall we?"
msgstr ""

#. comic186 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddsit.gif
#: kidradd/comic186.htm:82
msgctxt "comic186#p1.2"
msgid "Man, this cell is about as escape-proof as they come."
msgstr ""

#. comic186 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, cellwall.jpg
#: kidradd/comic186.htm:134
msgctxt "comic186#p2.1"
msgid "Just four solid walls, a featureless floor and ceiling, and an unexplained source of light."
msgstr ""

#. comic186 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddwow.gif, cellwall.jpg
#: kidradd/comic186.htm:185
msgctxt "comic186#p3.1"
msgid "No windows. No doors. No ventilation whatsoever."
msgstr ""

#. comic186 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddargh.gif, cellwall.jpg
#: kidradd/comic186.htm:237
msgctxt "comic186#p4.1"
msgid "For crying out loud, I could <b>suffocate</b> in here!"
msgstr ""

#. comic186 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsigh.gif, cellwall.jpg
#: kidradd/comic186.htm:290
msgctxt "comic186#p5.1"
msgid "That is, if sprites had to breathe. Yeah."
msgstr ""

#. comic187 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic187.htm:35
msgctxt "comic187#title.1"
msgid "\"GOING SLIGHTLY MAD\""
msgstr ""

#. comic187 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsit.gif, cellwall.jpg
#: kidradd/comic187.htm:76
msgctxt "comic187#p1.1"
msgid "Not that I miss it, but my user hasn't pulled me out of this cell for a while."
msgstr ""

#. comic187 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, cellwall.jpg
#: kidradd/comic187.htm:132
msgctxt "comic187#p2.1"
msgid "She's probably called the consumer service line by now, and they'll think she's crazy."
msgstr ""

#. comic187 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddblink.gif, cellwall.jpg
#: kidradd/comic187.htm:183
msgctxt "comic187#p3.1"
msgid "\"Your Office Assistant won't help me! Everytime I click him, he just flips me off!\""
msgstr ""

#. comic187 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsit.gif, cellwall.jpg
#: kidradd/comic187.htm:235
msgctxt "comic187#p4.1"
msgid "I guess even imprisonment has its perks."
msgstr ""

#. comic188 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic188.htm:35
msgctxt "comic188#title.1"
msgid "\"DESPERATION\""
msgstr ""

#. comic188 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: raddmad.gif
#: kidradd/comic188.htm:72
msgctxt "comic188#p1.1"
msgid "Time drags on painfully slow for Radd."
msgstr ""

#. comic188 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddmad.gif
#: kidradd/comic188.htm:82
msgctxt "comic188#p1.2"
msgid "I can't take this anymore!"
msgstr ""

#. comic188 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddfire.gif
#: kidradd/comic188.htm:134
msgctxt "comic188#p2.1"
msgid "There's gotta be a way outta here! Gotta!"
msgstr ""

#. comic188 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsits2.gif, cellwall.jpg
#: kidradd/comic188.htm:185
msgctxt "comic188#p3.1"
msgid "It's no use. Even my Mega Radd doesn't scratch it, rrgh."
msgstr ""

#. comic188 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddargh.gif, cellwall.jpg
#: kidradd/comic188.htm:237
msgctxt "comic188#p4.1"
msgid "Damn you, Moderators! Could you possibly ruin my life any more?!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic188 panel p5
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: modt.gif, modt3.gif
#: kidradd/comic188.htm:286
msgctxt "comic188#p5.1"
msgid "Actually, yes."
msgstr ""

#. comic188 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: modt.gif, modt3.gif
#: kidradd/comic188.htm:292
msgctxt "comic188#p5.2"
msgid "So the Captain wants us to hire a hitman?"
msgstr ""

#. comic188 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: modt.gif, modt3.gif
#: kidradd/comic188.htm:296
msgctxt "comic188#p5.3"
msgid "Oh yeah. The best money can buy."
msgstr ""

#. comic189 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic189.htm:35
msgctxt "comic189#title.1"
msgid "\"DIRTY DEEDS DONE DIRT CHEAP\""
msgstr ""

#. comic189 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: modt.gif, modt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic189.htm:72
msgctxt "comic189#p1.1"
msgid "Captain QB's two nameless flunkies sort out their latest task."
msgstr ""

#. comic189 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: modt.gif, modt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic189.htm:78
msgctxt "comic189#p1.2"
msgid "Why can't QB get rid of this guy himself?"
msgstr ""

#. comic189 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: modt.gif, modt2.gif
#: kidradd/comic189.htm:82
msgctxt "comic189#p1.3"
msgid "Stupid, he can't have any illegal activities connected to us."
msgstr ""

#. comic189 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: modt.gif, modtp.gif
#: kidradd/comic189.htm:134
msgctxt "comic189#p2.1"
msgid "So where we gonna find a hitman?"
msgstr ""

#. comic189 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: modt.gif, modtp.gif
#: kidradd/comic189.htm:138
msgctxt "comic189#p2.2"
msgid "Classifieds. Duh."
msgstr ""

#. comic189 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: modt3.gif, modtp.gif
#: kidradd/comic189.htm:185
msgctxt "comic189#p3.1"
msgid "What's our price range?"
msgstr ""

#. comic189 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: modt3.gif, modtp.gif
#: kidradd/comic189.htm:189
msgctxt "comic189#p3.2"
msgid "QB gave us ten grand. I guess he wants a quality job."
msgstr ""

#. comic189 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: modt.gif, modtp.gif
#: kidradd/comic189.htm:237
msgctxt "comic189#p4.1"
msgid "You're kidding. How hard can it be to off a guy <b>in jail?</b> Let's find someone cheap and keep the extra dough."
msgstr ""

#. comic189 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: modt.gif, modtp.gif
#: kidradd/comic189.htm:241
msgctxt "comic189#p4.2"
msgid "Now you're speaking my language."
msgstr ""

#. comic189 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: modt.gif, modtp.gif
#: kidradd/comic189.htm:291
msgctxt "comic189#p5.1"
msgid "Here's one! \"Kobayashi - Discount Ninja.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic189 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: modt.gif, modtp.gif
#: kidradd/comic189.htm:295
msgctxt "comic189#p5.2"
msgid "Twenty bucks. Sweet!"
msgstr ""
